{"speciesId":462,"names":{"fr":"Magnézone","es":"Magnezone","en":"Magnezone","ja":"ジバコイル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A group tried to use scientific means to make MAGNEZONE evolve, but their efforts ended in failure."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Exposure to a special magnetic field changed MAGNETON’s molecular structure, turning it into MAGNEZONE."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Exposure to a special magnetic field changed MAGNETON’s molecular structure, turning it into MAGNEZONE."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Des scientifiques ont essayé de faire évoluer un Magnézone en laboratoire, mais ce fut un échec."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A group tried to use scientific means to make Magnezone evolve, but their efforts ended in failure."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Des scientifiques ont essayé de faire évoluer un Magnézone en laboratoire, mais ce fut un échec."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A group tried to use scientific means to make Magnezone evolve, but their efforts ended in failure."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Sometimes the magnetism emitted by Magnezone is too strong, making them attract each other so they cannot move."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Sometimes the magnetism emitted by Magnezone is too strong, making them attract each other so they cannot move."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le champ magnétique qu’ils émettent est tel qu’ils ont tendance à s’attirer mutuellement et à s’empêcher de bouger."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Emiten campos magnéticos tan potentes que se atraen entre sí e incluso pueden llegar a inmovilizarse."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Sometimes the magnetism emitted by Magnezone is too strong, making them attract each other so they cannot move."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"強すぎる 磁力を だして ジバコイル同士 引き寄せあって まったく 動けなくなったりする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il a évolué suite à son exposition à un champ magnétique spécial. Ses 3 unités génèrent du magnétisme."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Evolucionó por la exposición a un campo magnético especial. Tres unidades generan magnetismo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"特殊な 磁場の 影響で レアコイルが 進化した。３つの ユニットから 磁力を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le champ magnétique qu’ils émettent est tel qu’ils ont tendance à s’attirer mutuellement et à s’empêcher de bouger."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Emiten campos magnéticos tan potentes que se atraen entre sí e incluso pueden llegar a inmovilizarse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sometimes the magnetism emitted by Magnezone is too strong, making them attract each other so they cannot move."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"強すぎる 磁力を だして ジバコイル同士 引き寄せあって まったく 動けなくなったりする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il a évolué suite à son exposition à un champ magnétique spécial. Ses trois unités génèrent du magnétisme."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Evolucionó por la exposición a un campo magnético especial. Tres unidades generan magnetismo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"特殊な 磁場の 影響で レアコイルが 進化した。３つの ユニットから 磁力を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ses trois unités émettent une force magnétique. Il n’est pas rare que les gens le confondent avec un OVNI quand il vole dans le ciel."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Sus tres unidades generan un campo magnético. Al ser avistados volando por la noche, muchos los han tomado por ovnis."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Three units generate magnetism. There have been many mistaken reports of UFO sightings when Magnezone flies through the night sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"３つの ユニットから 磁力を だす。 夜空を 飛ぶ ジバコイルを ＵＦＯと 間違える 報告が 多発。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il vole dans le ciel en émettant et en recevant des ondes bien mystérieuses."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se dice que mientras vuela emite unas ondas eléctricas misteriosas, a la vez que recibe otras ondas desconocidas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"As it zooms through the sky, this Pokémon seems to be receiving signals of unknown origin, while transmitting signals of unknown purpose."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"怪電波を 発信 しながら 空を 飛び回り 未知の 電波を 受信 していると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il surveille son territoire à l’aide de son radar, et élimine rapidement tout intrus avec son laser destructeur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Gracias a su radar detecta a cualquier intruso que se adentre en su territorio y lo elimina sin miramientos con su rayo destructor."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It uses radar to monitor its territory. Intruders are quickly disposed of with a hyper beam."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"自分の テリトリーを レーダーで 監視 している。 侵入者は 破壊光線で ただちに 処分。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"De nombreuses personnes pensent encore qu’il s’agit d’un Pokémon venu de l’espace. Il émet un champ magnétique extrêmement puissant."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Todavía hay quien cree hoy en día que proviene del espacio. Emite un campo magnético de gran potencia."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"There are still people who believe that this Pokémon came from outer space. It emanates a powerful magnetic field."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"未だに 宇宙から やってきたと 信じる 人々も いる。 強力な 磁力を 放つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On raconte qu’il serait contrôlé par une entité extraterrestre grâce à des ondes qu’il capterait avec l’antenne sur sa tête."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se cree que con la antena que tiene en la cabeza recibe señales del espacio enviadas por un ser que lo controla."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Some say that Magnezone receives signals from space via the antenna on its head and that it’s being controlled by some mysterious being."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"頭の アンテナで 宇宙からの 電波を 受信して 何者かに コントロールされていると いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On pense qu’il a évolué après avoir été exposé à un champ magnétique particulier qui a modifié la structure moléculaire de son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se piensa que estuvo expuesto a un campo magnético especial que alteró su estructura molecular e hizo que evolucionara."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s thought that a special magnetic field changed the molecular structure of this Pokémon’s body, and that’s what caused the Pokémon’s evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"特殊な 磁場の 影響で 体の 分子構造が 変化し 進化したと 考えられている。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"I theorize that a special magnetic field influenced this Pokémon, changing its molecular structure and causing it to evolve. It emits strange radio waves toward space from its antenna."}],"varieties":[{"id":462,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0